<em>Ted Lasso</em> is one of the most popular shows ever released on the Apple TV streaming service. The eponymous character Ted Lasso, played by Jason Sudeikis, starts off as a small-time football coach from Kansas who is hired to coach a professional soccer team in England, despite having no experience coaching soccer.<br/>
<br/>
In the fourth season, Apple said Lasso returns to England to take on his biggest challenge yet: coaching a second division women's soccer team. <br/>
